    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. 为什么要做特征工程？\n",
    "\n",
    "### ML量化的核心公式\n",
    "\n",
    "$$R_{t+1} = f(X_t) + \\varepsilon_t$$\n",
    "\n",
    "其中 $X_t$ 是 t 时刻已知的因子特征，$f$ 是 ML 模型。\n",
    "\n",
    "**Garbage In, Garbage Out** — 垃圾数据进去，垃圾预测出来。特征工程决定模型效果的上限。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 特征工程的四个环节\n",
    "\n",
    "| 环节 | 目标 | 在本 Notebook 的位置 |\n",
    "|------|------|---------------------|\n",
    "| 1. 缺失值处理 | 让数据完整可用 | 第2节 |\n",
    "| 2. 去极值 | 消除异常值的干扰 | 第3节 |\n",
    "| 3. 标准化 | 让不同量纲的特征可比 | 第4节 |\n",
    "| 4. 特征构造 | 从原始数据提炼信号 | 第5节 |\n",
    "| 5. 时序划分 | 避免前视偏差 | 第6节 |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. 数据获取与初步探索\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2.1 构建原始数据集\n",
    "\n",
    "从 AKShare 获取沪深300成分股的日线数据，构造基础特征。\n",
    "如果网络不可用，自动降级为模拟数据。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "def load_data(use_real=True, n_stocks=50, n_days=500):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    获取或生成数据。优先使用 AKShare 真实数据，失败则用模拟数据。\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    if use_real:\n",
    "        try:\n",
    "            import akshare as ak\n",
    "            print('📡 获取沪深300成分股...')\n",
    "            hs300 = ak.index_stock_cons_csindex(symbol='000300')\n",
    "            stocks = hs300['成分券代码'].tolist()[:n_stocks]\n",
    "            print(f'沪深300成分股: {len(stocks)}只（演示用）')\n",
    "            \n",
    "            # 获取日线数据\n",
    "            print('📡 获取日线数据 (预计1-2分钟)...')\n",
    "            daily_price = {}\n",
    "            daily_volume = {}\n",
    "            daily_turn = {}\n",
    "            for i, code in enumerate(stocks):\n",
    "                try:\n",
    "                    df = ak.stock_zh_a_hist(symbol=code, period='daily',\n",
    "                                            start_date='20230101', end_date='20260625',\n",
    "                                            adjust='qfq')\n",
    "                    df['日期'] = pd.to_datetime(df['日期'])\n",
    "                    df = df.set_index('日期').sort_index()\n",
    "                    if len(df) >= 200:\n",
    "                        daily_price[code] = df['收盘']\n",
    "                        daily_volume[code] = df['成交量']\n",
    "                        if '换手率' in df.columns:\n",
    "                            daily_turn[code] = df['换手率']\n",
    "                except Exception:\n",
    "                    pass\n",
    "                if (i+1) % 10 == 0:\n",
    "                    print(f'  进度: {i+1}/{len(stocks)} (成功{len(daily_price)}只)')\n",
    "                time.sleep(0.15)\n",
    "            \n",
    "            if len(daily_price) >= 20:\n",
    "                price_df = pd.DataFrame(daily_price)\n",
    "                volume_df = pd.DataFrame(daily_volume)\n",
    "                turn_df = pd.DataFrame(daily_turn) if daily_turn else None\n",
    "                print(f'\\n✅ 真实数据: {price_df.shape[0]}个交易日 × {price_df.shape[1]}只股票')\n",
    "                return price_df, volume_df, turn_df\n",
    "            else:\n",
    "                print('⚠️ 真实数据不足，切换到模拟数据')\n",
    "        except Exception as e:\n",
    "            print(f'⚠️ AKShare 不可用 ({e})，切换到模拟数据')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 模拟数据\n",
    "    print(f'🔄 生成模拟数据: {n_stocks}只股票 × {n_days}天')\n",
    "    np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "    dates = pd.date_range('2023-01-01', periods=n_days, freq='B')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 模拟相关性结构\n",
    "    market_return = np.random.normal(0.0005, 0.012, n_days)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    price_data = {}\n",
    "    volume_data = {}\n",
    "    for i in range(n_stocks):\n",
    "        beta = np.random.uniform(0.5, 1.5)\n",
    "        stock_return = beta * market_return + np.random.normal(0, 0.015, n_days)\n",
    "        price = 100 * (1 + stock_return).cumprod()\n",
    "        price_data[f'stock_{i:03d}'] = price\n",
    "        volume_data[f'stock_{i:03d}'] = np.random.lognormal(14, 0.8, n_days).astype(int)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    price_df = pd.DataFrame(price_data, index=dates)\n",
    "    volume_df = pd.DataFrame(volume_data, index=dates)\n",
    "    print(f'✅ 模拟数据生成完毕')\n",
    "    return price_df, volume_df, None\n",
    "\n",
    "# 获取数据（优先真实数据）\n",
    "price_raw, volume_raw, turn_raw = load_data(use_real=True, n_stocks=50)\n",
    "print(f'价格数据: {price_raw.shape}')\n",
    "print(f'成交量数据: {volume_raw.shape}')"
